{
  "$comment": "Published packages from carbon-design-system/carbon. `dir` is the folder under packages/ upstream. `optional` packages are tested when the release includes them but do not fail resolution when missing. @carbon/upgrade is excluded until next publishes its v12 codemods; its version on next is still the v11 release. `nodeLoad: false` skips loading the package entry point in Node because it needs a browser.",
